license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-07-04'
abstract: >-
  Embedded32 is an open-source TypeScript monorepo for learning and prototyping
  embedded vehicle networks: CAN bus abstraction, an educational subset of SAE
  J1939, multi-ECU simulation, diagnostics, and CAN-to-Ethernet/MQTT bridging.
  It includes hardware-free classroom labs, synthetic bus traces, a browser
  educational demo, and npm packages under the @embedded32 scope. The platform
  is for teaching and experimentation — not automotive safety certification.
keywords:
  - embedded-systems
  - can-bus
  - sae-j1939
  - ecu-simulation
  - typescript
  - education
  - diagnostics
  - vehicle-networks
